ss=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Written by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"illustration\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Illustrated by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"colors\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Colors by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miquel_Muerto\" title=\"Miquel Muerto\">Miquel Muerto</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"letters\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Lettered by</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/AndWorld_Design\" title=\"AndWorld Design\">AndWorld Design</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"release_date\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Release date</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">December 23, 2020</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Chronology</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_12\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 12\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #12</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_14\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children 14\"><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #14</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b><i>Something Is Killing the Children</i> #13</b> is a horror comic from <a href=\"/wiki/James_Tynion_IV\" title=\"James Tynion IV\">James Tynion IV</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Werther_Dell%27Edera\" title=\"Werther Dell&#39;Edera\">Werther Dell'Edera</a> that was published on December 23, 2020 by <a href=\"/wiki/Boom!_Studios\" title=\"Boom! Studios\">Boom! Studios</a>. It is the thirteenth issue in the <i><a href=\"/wiki/Something_Is_Killing_the_Children_(comic_series)\" title=\"Something Is Killing the Children (comic series)\">Something Is Killing the Children</a></i> comic series, the third issue of the five-part <i><a href=\"/wiki/A_Game_of_Nowhere_(comic_arc)\" title=\"A Game of Nowhere (comic arc)\">A Game of Nowhere</a></i> arc, and the thirteenth issue of the fifteen-part <i>Archer's Peak</i> saga.\n</p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Synopsis\">Synopsis</span></h2>\n<blockquote><p>The monsters in Archer's Peak have surrounded the school where <a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica</a> and <span class=\"new\" title=\"Tommy (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVG9tbXk/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Tommy</span> make their last stand. Even if the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Slaughter\" title=\"House of Slaughter\">House of Slaughter</a> can save them, will the price of their help be too high?<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Plot\">Plot</span></h2>\n<p>An Oscuratype feeds on <a href=\"/wiki/Aaron_Slaughter\" title=\"Aaron Slaughter\">Aaron Slaughter</a>'s body, then looks up to see <a href=\"/wiki/Maxine_Slaughter\" title=\"Maxine Slaughter\">Maxine Slaughter</a>. Behind them, several <a href=\"/wiki/White_Mask\" title=\"White Mask\">White Masks</a> appear and take down the creature. Maxine takes Aaron's mask, and tells them that they are going to kill the people in the school. \n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a> shields <a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a> from Richards's death, as Cecilia tells her that this is her fault for not following protocol. Erica angrily tells her that they should have come when several dozen kids died, rather than just to kill humans. Cecilia tells Erica that she's going to send her back to the House of Slaughter, and take the children to finish the ritual. However, a dying Richards raises a gun, trying to shoot Cecilia. As she stabs him through the head, Erica uses the distraction to take <a href=\"/wiki/Bian\" title=\"Bian\">Bian</a> and James and run. Racing through the woods, Erica carries Bian and has James take her to his house.\n</p><p>Maxine tells the Sheriff to let her inside, as she signals for the other White Masks to find a way in. Inside, <a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Joe Cavanaugh\">Joe Cavanaugh</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a> discuss the situation, as Tommy says he does not trust Erica's people. The lights shut off, and Maxine drives a car through the gymnasium doors in order to enter. She demands everyone get into the center of the room.\n</p><p>At James's house, Erica tells the children that this is going to be dangerous and scary, but they need to answer her questions honestly and directly. She tells <a href=\"/wiki/Octo\" title=\"Octo\">Octo</a> to show the children his real face, as she begins the ritual.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Characters\">Characters</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Order_of_St._George\"><a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_St._George\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Order of St. George\">Order of St. George</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Octo\" title=\"Octo\">Octo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cecilia_Slaughter\" title=\"Cecilia Slaughter\">Cecilia Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Erica_Slaughter\" title=\"Erica Slaughter\">Erica Slaughter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Maxine_Slaughter\" title=\"Maxine Slaughter\">Maxine Slaughter</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"Archer.27s_Peak\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Archer's_Peak\"><a href=\"/wiki/Archer%27s_Peak\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak\">Archer's Peak</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bian\" title=\"Bian\">Bian</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Joe Cavanaugh\">Sheriff Joe Cavanaugh</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Henry\" title=\"Henry\">Henry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ms._Mahoney\" title=\"Ms. Mahoney\">Ms. Mahoney</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/John_Richards\" title=\"John Richards\">Officer John Richards</a> †</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Monsters\"><a href=\"/wiki/Monster\" title=\"Monster\">Monsters</a></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oscuratypes\">Oscuratypes</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Archer's Peak Oscuratype children</span></li></ul>